{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":2,"timestamp":1784202412,"nonce":"ZjI7mVdPNWRyj3fwcV05ohBU+Vw=","title":"[ADR-0045] Scoped short-TTL read-only-for-forks clone-token minting + tmpfs delivery","was":"Mint a scoped forge token for the `clone` step and deliver it securely (ADR-0045 §Trust, §Token delivery). For a run, the control plane produces a **short-TTL (minutes), repo-scoped** token — **read-only for fork-PR runs** — and delivers it to the `scarab-clone` Pod via a tmpfs file under `/scarab/secrets/`, consumed by the image's `GIT_ASKPASS` helper. The remote URL persisted in `.git/config` stays credential-free (guarded by the S2 scrub check)."}]}